 - document create/draft/publish/archive/move/revision history;
 - task and phase dossier document links;
 - URL/file evidence and attachment command assembly;
+- evidence registry criteria and cursor pagination by `(created_at DESC, id DESC)`; filters and case-insensitive substring search execute in PostgreSQL before the 20-row UI page is selected;
 - search criteria normalization and result shaping;
 - template create/list rules;
 - audit command normalization.
diff --git a/docs/CLI.md b/docs/CLI.md
index ec992dc..7e92e45 100644
--- a/docs/CLI.md
+++ b/docs/CLI.md
@@ -125,8 +125,11 @@ wiki evidence add-link --space SDLC --document <document-id> --task SDLC-42 --ph
 wiki evidence add-file --space SDLC --document <document-id> --task SDLC-42 --phase testing --file ./screen.png
 wiki evidence get <evidence-id>
 wiki evidence list --space SDLC --document <document-id> --limit 30
+wiki evidence list --space SDLC --query "smoke" --limit 20 --cursor <next_cursor>
 ```
 
+`wiki evidence list` returns `next_cursor` with the current page. Pass it as `--cursor` with unchanged filters to continue; `--query` searches the full accessible evidence registry, not only the current page.
+
